				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "&4The Void Signal"
			x: -10.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3055000000000001"]
			description: [
				"The signal on the Moon triangulates to wherever you are. Stand in your arena and &cclaim this quest to answer it&r."
				""
				"&8It will be standing there when the dust settles.&r"
			]
