			dependencies: ["3055000000000002"]
			description: [
				"A pillar of living obsidian that was on the Moon long before you. The &eObsidilith&r fights in phases - runes, pillars, bursts. Read the arena, not the boss."
				""
				"It drops the &5Obsidian Heart&r: the first corner of the Heart of the Sky. &7(It also rises naturally in the End's outer islands, if you'd rather hunt it at home.)&r"
