		{
			dependencies: [
				"3055000000000003"
				"7AEFF5201E41906E"
			]
			description: [
				"On Mars the signal comes from &cunder the soil&r. Stand in your arena and claim - and watch the red sand split open."
				""
				"&c&lThis is a Heart of the Sky component.&r The &7Void Thorn&r this fight drops is one of the four Void Signal relics cornering the win condition. It is not optional content."
				""
				"&e&lThe Void Blossom&r fights from a fixed position and covers the ground in spore fields and thorn spikes. It is an arena fight in the literal sense - the floor is the danger, not the boss."
				"&7- &fKeep moving.&7 Standing still in a spore field is what kills people."
				"&7- &fBuild your arena before you claim&r - a flat, walled, well-lit platform with no holes. Fighting this in open Martian terrain is far harder."
				"&7- &fBring ranged options.&7 Closing distance repeatedly through the floor hazards is expensive."
				""
				"&c&lRemember you are on Mars.&r Oxygen is still draining while you fight. Bring a spare tank, or set up an Oxygen Distributor in the arena so the fight is not on a timer."
				""
				"&8Claim the quest only when the arena is finished and you are geared. The boss spawns immediately."
			]
			icon: "bosses_of_mass_destruction:void_lily"
			id: "3055000000000004"
			rewards: [{
				command: "/summon bosses_of_mass_destruction:void_blossom ~ ~1 ~"
				id: "3055000000000104"
				type: "command"
			}]
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "&c&lCLAIM = SUMMON. Arena first."
			tasks: [{
				id: "3055000000000204"
				title: "Broadcast from your Mars base"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "&4Beacon: The Red Soil"
			x: -4.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3055000000000004"]
			description: [
				"An alien flower the size of a house, blooming where nothing should live. The &eVoid Blossom&r spawns spines, blades and healing roots - cut the roots first."
				""
				"It drops the &5Void Thorn&r: the second corner. Eat its Crystal Fruit for a hearts boost that lasts."
