		{
			dependencies: [
				"3055000000000005"
				"45A0F1081A90EE29"
			]
			description: [
				"Venus screams on every frequency. Something in the acid clouds is transmitting through a fist of soulfire. Arena. Claim. Brace."
				""
				"&c&lAnother Heart component.&r The &7Blazing Eye&r from the Gauntlet is Void Signal relic number three."
				""
				"&e&lThe Gauntlet&r is a giant hand that erupts from the ground, slams, and fires soulfire beams. It is largely stationary but its reach is enormous."
				"&7- &fStrafe, do not back up.&7 Its slams track forward; circling is safer than retreating."
				"&7- &fSoulfire ignores normal fire resistance&r - do not assume a potion covers it."
				"&7- &fIt has an invulnerable phase&7 where it withdraws. Use it to heal and reposition rather than wasting hits."
				""
				"&c&lVenus is the hardest place to fight anything.&r Acid rain damages you throughout, on top of the boss. A &7Netherite Space Suit&r and a sealed, roofed arena are close to mandatory here - the roof stops the rain, which turns an unfair fight into a fair one."
				""
				"&8Of the four relic fights, this is the one most worth over-preparing for. Build the arena properly."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:soul_lantern"
			id: "3055000000000006"
			rewards: [{
				command: "/summon bosses_of_mass_destruction:gauntlet ~ ~1 ~"
				id: "3055000000000106"
