			description: [
				"A colossal armored fist animated by burning souls. The &eGauntlet&r grabs, slams and hurls - keep moving, strike the eye when it opens."
				""
				"It drops the &5Blazing Eye&r: the third corner. &7(Its kin haunt the Nether's soul valleys too.)&r"
