		{
			dependencies: [
				"3055000000000007"
				"3811F52536EF179D"
			]
			description: [
				"Glacio's night lasts forever, and the signal here sounds like a funeral bell. Whatever answers on the frozen edge of the system, it has been dead a long time."
				""
				"&c&lThe last of the four Heart components.&r The &7Soul Star&r from the Void Lich is Void Signal relic number four - and with it the corners of the Heart of the Sky are complete."
				""
				"&c&lThis is the Night Lich&r - Bosses of Mass Destruction's, summoned at its own beacon rather than found in a dungeon."
				""
				"&e&lThe Void Lich&r teleports constantly, summons skeletal minions, and fires homing soul projectiles. It is a mobility fight - you will spend more time chasing than swinging."
				"&7- &fClear the adds first&7 or they will chip you down while you chase."
				"&7- &fA bow or a projectile spell&7 is far more useful than melee for the teleport phases."
				"&7- &fRoof the arena.&7 It likes to teleport out of reach vertically."
				"&7- &fBring a lot of food.&7 This is the longest of the four fights."
				""
				"&7Glacio is cold and dark but not corrosive - it is a kinder venue than Venus. Bring lighting; the permanent night means mobs spawn throughout.&r"
				""
				"&8Once this drops, you have all four relics. What remains between you and the ending is the Celestial Core - four Aether dungeon keys, the Monstrous Horn, a Nether Star and three planet metals."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:soul_torch"
			id: "3055000000000008"
			rewards: [{
